DESCRIPTION:Mature Student Coffee Break - Thursday\, September 10th\n\nExc
 ited to meet other mature students? On Thursday\, September 10th drop by a
 nd connect with fellow students at the Mature Students Coffee Break from 1
 1:30 a.m. to 2:30 p.m.\, hosted by the Mature Students Collective in MCA 2
